<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Glass says 9-mth net down 8.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Glass says 9-mth net down 8.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Ceylon Glass Company Ltd for nine months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		 1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	  484.99    vs     476.34</p>
<p>     Net profit	 55.08    vs	60.06</p>
<p>NOTE - Ceylon Glass Co is Sri Lanka's monopoly maker of glass packing containers.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
